const zooNames=['高幡不動','多摩動物公園'],zooKana=['たかはたふどう','たまどうぶつこうえん'];let zooStation=0,zooPaid=false,zooEntry=null,zooRide=null,zooLast='';
// One shuttle on a two-station branch: it reverses at each end, never crossing itself.
function zooState(){const age=((time%112)+112)%112;if(age<18)return{pos:0,at:0,next:1,dir:1,door:age>=2&&age<16,remaining:18-age,age};if(age<56)return{pos:ease((age-18)/38),next:1,dir:1,door:false,age};if(age<74)return{pos:1,at:1,next:0,dir:-1,door:age>=58&&age<72,remaining:74-age,age:age-56};return{pos:1-ease((age-74)/38),next:0,dir:-1,door:false,age};}
function zooWait(){const age=((time%112)+112)%112,arrival=zooStation===0?0:56;return Math.ceil((arrival-age+112)%112);}
function zooPois(){if(scene==='zooHall')return[...(zooPaid&&zooStation===0?[{id:'mainLink',x:600,y:190,label:'京王線 調布方面へ歩く'}]:[]),{id:'zooGate',x:600,y:zooPaid?320:455,label:zooPaid?'ICタッチ · 京王出場':'ICタッチ · 京王入場'},{id:'zooCharge',x:900,y:zooPaid?300:480,label:'チャージ +300'},{id:'zooStairs',x:300,y:205,label:zooStation===0?'1番線 · 動物園線へ':'動物園線ホームへ'},{id:'zooOutside',x:600,y:715,label:'改札の外へ · モノレール乗換'}];if(scene==='zooPlatform')return[{id:'zooDown',x:170,y:630,label:'階段 · 京王改札へ'},{id:'zooTrain',x:600,y:450,label:'動物園線に乗る'},{id:'zooStamp',x:1030,y:615,label:'動物園線の駅スタンプ'}];if(scene==='zooCar')return[{id:'zooDoor',x:600,y:605,label:'開いたドアから降りる'},{id:'zooWindow',x:200,y:630,label:'線路と景色を見る'}];return null;}
function zooInteract(id){if(id==='zooEntrance'){if(monoPaid){toast('先刷卡出单轨车站，再步行换乘京王。');return true;}zooStation=monoStation===6?0:1;go('zooHall',600,670);say('京王動物園線へ、ようこそ。','けいおうどうぶつえんせんへ、ようこそ。','这条京王支线直接往返高幡不動和多摩動物公園，不停程久保。');return true;}if(!scene.startsWith('zoo'))return false;if(id==='zooGate'){if(zooPaid){const fare=(keioOrigin??(zooEntry===0?"takahata":"zoo"))===(zooStation===0?"takahata":"zoo")?0:80;if(profile.ic<fare){toast('余额不足。先到同侧充值机精算，零钱不足可领取援助。');return true;}profile.ic-=fare;zooPaid=false;zooEntry=null;keioOrigin=null;toast(`ピッ · 京王出場 −${fare} 游戏円`);}else{if(profile.ic<80){toast('IC余额不足，请先充值。');return true;}zooPaid=true;zooEntry=zooStation;keioOrigin=zooStation===0?"takahata":"zoo";toast('ピッ · 京王入場（与单轨分别计费）');}save();tone(1320,.12);tone(1760,.1,'sine',.04,.13);gateUntil=time+1.1;transition={start:time,from:{...player},to:{x:600,y:zooPaid?312:465},duration:1};path=[];updateUI();return true;}if(id==='zooCharge'){if(profile.coins<300){openModal('<h2>駅員さんのお手伝い</h2><p>可领取援助，再回来充值。</p><button data-do="aid">旅行援助</button>');return true;}profile.coins-=300;profile.ic+=300;save();chime();toast('チャージ +300');updateUI();return true;}if(id==='zooStairs'){if(!zooPaid){toast('先刷 IC 卡进入京王改札。');return true;}go('zooPlatform',170,620);return true;}if(id==='zooDown'){go('zooHall',300,230);return true;}if(id==='zooOutside'){if(zooPaid){toast('先刷 IC 卡出站，再换乘单轨。');return true;}monoStation=zooStation===0?6:4;monoDirection=-1;go('monoTown',225,350);return true;}if(id==='zooTrain'){const s=zooState();if(!s.door||s.at!==zooStation){toast('等列车停稳开门。');return true;}zooRide={from:zooStation};zooLast='';profile.zooRides++;unlock('models','7000系（動物園線）');save();go('zooCar',600,620);return true;}if(id==='zooDoor'){const s=zooState();if(!s.door){toast('车门还未打开。错过下车可以跟着列车折返。');return true;}zooStation=s.at;if(zooStation!==zooRide.from)unlock('souvenirs','京王動物園線 乗車記念');zooRide=null;go('zooPlatform',600,465);chime();return true;}if(id==='zooStamp'){unlock('zooStamps',zooStation);chime();toast(zooNames[zooStation]+' · 京王站印章已保存');return true;}if(id==='zooWindow'){dialog('動物園線の車窓','程久保には、止まりません。','ほどくぼには、とまりません。','京王動物園線中途没有车站。程久保站属于多摩モノレール。留意铁路和高架单轨的不同风景。');return true;}return false;}
