function drawZooPassengers(platform){if(!platform){drawCarActors();return;}const s=zooState(),dwell=s.at!==undefined,u=dwell?clamp((s.age-2)/12,0,1):1,leaving=dwell&&s.age>=2&&s.age<8,boarding=dwell&&s.age>=8&&s.age<14;for(let i=0;i<2;i++){const seat=[220,974][i],color=(Math.floor(time/56)+i)%2?'#849dac':'#b89b7f';if(platform){if(s.at!==zooStation||!s.door)continue;if(leaving||boarding){const f=leaving?(s.age-2)/6:1-(s.age-8)/6;person(600+(i?1:-1)*f*110,439+f*80,color,time*9);}}else{if(leaving||boarding){const f=leaving?1-(s.age-2)/6:(s.age-8)/6;person(600+(seat-600)*f,603-53*f,color,time*9);}else person(seat,550,color);}}}
